","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Mf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a4eba4f-345e-4065-b01f-e78b7274d8ee","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"JSのclassのbind問題みんなハマってそう","ts":"1625135784.018800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bxg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a1188c3-8185-47ad-8d20-b84d2ac6b7cc","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"```class A {\n  #denops: Denops\n  constructor(denops: Denops) {\n    this.#denops = denops;\n  }\n\n  hoge() {\n    this.#denops.dispatcher = {\n      async hoge(): Promise\u0026lt;void\u0026gt; {\n        await execute(this.#denops, \"echo hoge\");\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}```\nみたいにしたときに `execute()` で `Property '#denops' does not exist on type 'Session'` とエラーが出るんですが、これを回避するなんかよい方法ありますかねー\n多分`this` の型の問題なのでとりあえず内側の `async hoge()` を外で定義してやれば回避できるはできるんですが、他の方法ないかなと","ts":"1625135371.015200","thread_ts":"1625135371.015200","reply_count":9,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qir"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0C37AF0C-5DB5-46A7-96D5-07B120D9418F","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"hoge内部でdenopsを変数に束縛ですね","ts":"1625135439.015800","thread_ts":"1625135371.015200","parent_user_id":"UG6DF6W87","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NaeT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"BEBE7E49-2F2E-447D-B6CE-D2E4DC97F464","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"もしくはthisをbindする為に無名関数にする","ts":"1625135457.016400","thread_ts":"1625135371.015200","parent_user_id":"UG6DF6W87","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S2/b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3C8DA4F3-48BB-4A1C-90A5-C2010223FF86","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"hoge:　async()　=\u0026gt;　...","ts":"1625135489.017200","thread_ts":"1625135371.015200","parent_user_id":"UG6DF6W87","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wj1X3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb9555e9-6e7a-4a4d-9064-1fc30e8e614b","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、そうかなるほど!","ts":"1625135500.017400","thread_ts":"1625135371.015200","parent_user_id":"UG6DF6W87","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qMIq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40cd34d7-d051-43dd-997d-ba63162edf2f","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"おー通りました!\nありがとうございます!","ts":"1625135567.017600","thread_ts":"1625135371.015200","parent_user_id":"UG6DF6W87","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vVG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e51303a-660c-425b-86a9-05a3287792df","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"なるほど\n```hoge() {}```\nを\n```hoge: () =\u0026gt; {}```\nの略記だと勘違いしてました","ts":"1625135708.017900","thread_ts":"1625135371.015200","parent_user_id":"UG6DF6W87","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3P2X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5376b84b-b736-4fdf-8e61-8376e7806506","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"```function hoge() {}```\nの略記か...","ts":"1625135737.018100","thread_ts":"1625135371.015200","parent_user_id":"UG6DF6W87","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m9q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b7e7686-90db-404c-b181-f88bf9d38258","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、いやいや略記じゃない\n相当、か","ts":"1625135784.018600","thread_ts":"1625135371.015200","parent_user_id":"UG6DF6W87","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E2V1w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81DF6E19-ECFA-4B83-9AEC-CEE6F